      <guid>http://localhost:1313/community/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div style=&#34;width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1rem;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 style=&#34;text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;&#34;&gt;Community&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;width: min(56rem, 100%); margin: 0 auto;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;text-center text-lg&#34;&gt;Our group actively contributes to a broader computational science ecosystem through research networks, institutes, conferences, and journals. Below are key associations that connect our work to the internal and external communities.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;text-center text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4&#34;&gt;Internal Community&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;mt-4 mb-12&#34; style=&#34;display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://ias.uva.nl/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34; class=&#34;block rounded-xl p-3 transition-shadow&#34; style=&#34;width: fit-content; max-width: min(40rem, 100%);&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;flex items-center gap-3 justify-center&#34; style=&#34;width: fit-content; margin: 0 auto;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img&#xA;          class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md h-10 w-auto object-contain shrink-0&#34;&#xA;          loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;          decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;          fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;          alt=&#34;IAS UvA&#34;&#xA;          width=&#34;192&#34;&#xA;          height=&#34;192&#34;&#xA;          src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/community/logos/ias-uva_hu_528521f9d06cd40.png&#34;&#xA;          srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/community/logos/ias-uva_hu_528521f9d06cd40.png 800w,/community/logos/ias-uva_hu_dcf76d89c2cacc3d.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;          sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;          data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/community/logos/ias-uva.png&#34;&#xA;        /&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;text-xl font-semibold mb-1&#34;&gt;IAS UvA&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;text-base text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300&#34;&gt;The Institute for Advanced Study at the University of Amsterdam, fostering interdisciplinary collaboration on complex challenges.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
